  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkikoo naipirta ina kitoria e moikuape",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woi ninye ilo owuasa oata emaupe e nkitoo oo lamerak le Efraim, o ina tapukai natoyio oshi nara enkishiaa enye; naa ninye natii endukuya e ilo erata oleng le lelo ooidimua enaisho! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, eeta Olaitoriani ilo obo magilani negol; ore anaa olkutati le nchan oo soito otiu anaa olkutati le nkidaata netiu anaa enkare nagol nadooyo kelo ninye anang'aki enkop te ngoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo oata emaupe e nkitoo loo lamerak le Efraim, naa kepuoi aaitunyoki enkop too nkejek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina tapukai natoyio enkishiaa enye, natii endukuya e ilo erata oleng, naa ketiu anaa ilng'abolo le dukuya ooton eng'or te nkata e nkirowuaj: te nedol oltung'ani ilo ng'anayioi neinos nabo kata anaa ake pee eibung te nkaina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore kenya te ina olong naa Olaitoriani loo lororani olo aaku emaupe enkitoo, neaku enkishili e nkishiaa te ilo pisiai loo ltung'ana lenyena; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o ltau le sipata te ilo oton te nkiguana, o engolon te ilo oibelekeny olarrabal te kishomi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isaya o loibonok amerak le Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etarruoitie sii lekua te naisho, neyukuyukori te merai e naisho napi, ore olapolosani o laiboni netarruoitie te naisho; etomilote ninche te naisho neyukuyukori ninche te merai e naisho napi, etapaashari ninche te nduaata, nerrorro ninche edung enkiguana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eiputa lopat imesai pooki, meetae ewueji nemetii olduruk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kaing'ae ninye elo aiteng'en aitaarriyian, naa kaing'ae elo ninye ainosaki ilo kilikuai? Lelo ooereki",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ooereki",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "enkerai natooruoki, meekure enakita",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", lelo lemeekure enakita? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu enkiteng'enata te shumata nkiteng'enat, enkitanapata te shumata enkitanapata, olkereri te shumata olkereri, olkereri te shumata olkereri, etii enkiti ene netii enkiti idie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.14.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ilkor 14.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " A-a, kake too ltung'ana ooiro nkutukie nemeyioloi, neiro too lng'ejepa loo loreren, kelo Olaitoriani airorie iltung'ana lenyena, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laa ninche apa etiaaka, “Ena enkiyeng'iyeng inyi, enchoo eyeng'iyeng'a ilo onaure, naa ena enkiyagata inyi”; kake ore eyia mening'isho ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina kelo ororei lo Laitoriani aaku te ninche, enkiteng'enata te shumata nkiteng'enat, enkiteng'enata te shumata enkiteng'enata, olkereri te shumata olkereri, olkereri te shumata olkereri, enkiti tene, o enkiti te idie; pee etum ninche aashom, nebatatakino siadi, negila, nerreshi, neibung'i aaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Osoit lo lmairroto le Sion",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina, entoning naa ororei lo Laitoriani intae iloo menisho, intae lelo ooitore kulo tung'ana le Yerusalem! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu itejo apa intae, “Kintobira iyiook olning'o o keeya, ore enemeneng'a nikitoning'ote; te nelotu enkidaata nemeeta eneiko iyiook; amu kintaa iyiook elejare esarunoto ang, naa lomon lemesipa kilutoo iyiook”; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.118.22+PSA.118.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Olke 118.22-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Irm 9.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.10.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.2.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 2.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ore naa, nji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai, “Kairragie nanu te Sion osoit oaku olkitamanyunoto, osoit otujurruoki aatem, osoit ogol e nkinyiang'a lo lmairroto: ‘Ore ilo oiruk ninye nemeisarrisar.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kaitaa nanu esipata olgiita naitaa esupatisho ina temet e nkitorioroto; naa keoroo enchan oo soito ina lejare o mbaa nemesipa, neya enkare ilo ng'obor olutori.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo ning'o linyi o keeya neaku parmetii, ore ina nitoning'okinote o enemeneng'a nemeitoki auno; te nelotu enkidaata, naa eikiosh iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore ake enkata naba anaa enalotu nikiya iyie, amu kelotu ninye anaake tadekenya, o endama o enkewarie; ore eyiolounoto e ilo kilikuai naa olkirutoto ake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kedorropu endapash te neitorioo oltung'ani nkejek, naa ronkai olkarasha te nejo oltung'ani aitoipore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.10.10+JOS.10.11+JOS.10.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 10.10-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.5.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 5.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ilai 14.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amu kedumunye Olaitoriani anaa apa to ldoinyio le Perasim, naa kegoro ninye anaa apa to erata le Gibeon; pee atum ataasa enkiaas enye, napaashaa, neas esiaai enye, ina siaai enye nemeyioloi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata emimenaa, pee meitirrishi ake ienat inyi, amu atoning'oyie nanu endung'okinoto e nkiguana e mutai, eing'uaa Olaitoriani Enkai oo lororani, eipirta enkop pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eng'eno nagut e Nkai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchoru enkiok, toning'o oltoilo lai; toning'isho, naa toning'o enajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaa ilo oturisho pee eunisho keturisho anaake? Ketur ninye enkop enye neitupuyiapui enterit anaake? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaa te neidip ninye aitobira enterit, emeisuaaki ninye enkop ilanterera lenyena loo mpukunot pooki, neun enkano too lkererin nepik shairi ewueji enye, neitobiraki enerishare? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eiteng'enaki ninye aaitobiraki; Enkai enye naiteng'en ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu meidong'i ilmomo to soit oituutishoreki, nemeimieki ilanterera leijo lelo enkeju e ngarri; amu ore ilmomo o lanterera leijo lelo naa te ng'udi eidong'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keidong'i entapa oo mukateni? A-a, meidong'i o akenya; te nereu oltung'ani enkeju e ngarri enye te shumata e nkano eyiataa embarta, nemeidong ninye nagut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olaitoriani loo lororani sii eing'uaa ena; ole nking'asia ninye too nkikoot, naa arriyia aisul te ng'eno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
